      "content": "Hey, we have a massive problem. A memo just leaked showing the candidate voted against the community center funding bill last year. The local press is already starting to blow up my phone about it. If this gets out, our polling in the West End is gonna tank. How should we handle this when the reporters start asking questions tomorrow?",
